(7478347, 1188705, 182284, '<td valign="top">I really thought this would do much better but taking second look I think if you had added a little shadowing you would have gone to the top with this. You did a good job of blurring and I noticed that some who scored higher than you didn''t blur and it made the person look like a cut out. You never know what they will like. I think over all you did a great job.</td>', 'I really thought this would do much better but taking second look I think if you had added a little shadowing you would have gone to the top with this. You did a good job of blurring and I noticed that some who scored higher than you didn''t blur and it made the person look like a cut out. You never know what they will like. I think over all you did a great job.', '2016-10-14 01:58:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478348, 1188705, 36696, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cyrilda:</b></div><hr/><i> I really thought this would do much better but taking second look I think if you had added a little shadowing you would have gone to the top with this. You did a good job of blurring and I noticed that some who scored higher than you didn''t blur and it made the person look like a cut out. You never know what they will like. I think over all you did a great job. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah I thought it would have placed much higher too. Because of the way I put the person in I couldn''t add shadows and I noticed right after I submitted that it needed some shadows. Oh well, thanks for the comment! Hopefully they do another one of these contests.</td>', 'Originally posted by Cyrilda: I really thought this would do much better but taking second look I think if you had added a little shadowing you would have gone to the top with this. You did a good job of blurring and I noticed that some who scored higher than you didn''t blur and it made the person look like a cut out. You never know what they will like. I think over all you did a great job.   Yeah I thought it would have placed much higher too. Because of the way I put the person in I couldn''t add shadows and I noticed right after I submitted that it needed some shadows. Oh well, thanks for the comment! Hopefully they do another one of these contests.', '2016-10-14 02:10:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478349, 1188304, 182284, '<td valign="top">I think you should have made the top 3. Everything about this photo is perfect from the softening of the edges around the little guy to the shadows you added. Color was perfect as well as the size of the little man. You did a super job.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-10-14 23:18:21.</i></td>', 'I think you should have made the top 3. Everything about this photo is perfect from the softening of the edges around the little guy to the shadows you added. Color was perfect as well as the size of the little man. You did a super job.', '2016-10-14 03:03:43.000000', '2016-10-15 00:18:21.000000', 0),
