(7478709, 1188434, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>Well, Susan I really don''t know what has happened here but I posted a critique for this several days ago! To recap, your processing and composition are very effective. I like the softer focus gemstone background it helps define you well. The one thing that doesn''t work so well is the far background the highlights are somewhat distracting. BTW, your pose looks very professional well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge well. Well, Susan I really don''t know what has happened here but I posted a critique for this several days ago! To recap, your processing and composition are very effective. I like the softer focus gemstone background it helps define you well. The one thing that doesn''t work so well is the far background the highlights are somewhat distracting. BTW, your pose looks very professional well done.', '2016-10-18 06:04:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478736, 1188735, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> and the boy? will we ever know what he is thinking? </i></td></tr></table> No, he disappeared into the grass. We''ll never even see his face.</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: and the boy? will we ever know what he is thinking?  No, he disappeared into the grass. We''ll never even see his face.', '2016-10-18 16:46:14.000000', NULL, 0),
