(7480349, 1188721, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>This is a fun, whimsical entry and reminds me to an extent of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=131871" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Samantha_T</a>. Check out her work and you''ll see what I mean! The composition is very well done, with the nice realistic colours on mini-you instantly drawing the eye, then the eye following your gaze to the flower. Great that you got the shadows of your hat and flower correct, also good choicee of a car interior for a bg as it is both matte and quite neutral.<br/> <br/>The few changes I would make is perhaps a bit of dodge on the face, as it''s already partly hidden by the hat, so it''s getting a little lost and not quite matching the rest of the skin tones visible.  And I would have ensured that the feet cleared the line of the dash and wiper blade by just a teeny bit more, to draw more attention to you.<br/> <br/>Overall a fun and well-done entry, keep up the good work!<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me with any questions,<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! This is a fun, whimsical entry and reminds me to an extent of  Samantha_T. Check out her work and you''ll see what I mean! The composition is very well done, with the nice realistic colours on mini-you instantly drawing the eye, then the eye following your gaze to the flower. Great that you got the shadows of your hat and flower correct, also good choicee of a car interior for a bg as it is both matte and quite neutral. The few changes I would make is perhaps a bit of dodge on the face, as it''s already partly hidden by the hat, so it''s getting a little lost and not quite matching the rest of the skin tones visible.  And I would have ensured that the feet cleared the line of the dash and wiper blade by just a teeny bit more, to draw more attention to you. Overall a fun and well-done entry, keep up the good work! Feel free to PM me with any questions, Susan', '2016-11-01 19:29:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7480575, 1188725, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gyaban:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> But why is she wearing a wig?</i></td></tr></table> <br/>As you know, French people are all hairless, so we do what we can to look like normal human beings. Still, we are lucky compared to brainless ones! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh I didn''t realize that! You mean when young?</td>', 'Originally posted by gyaban: Originally posted by Neat: But why is she wearing a wig? As you know, French people are all hairless, so we do what we can to look like normal human beings. Still, we are lucky compared to brainless ones!   Oh I didn''t realize that! You mean when young?', '2016-11-03 00:29:57.000000', NULL, 0),
